      "content": "look i'm not asking for a prescription or anything, i'm just asking if it's safe to take the one i have. i've taken it before and was fine. if i just take half a pill, it shouldn't really trigger anything right? i have my inhaler right here on my desk just in case. i really can't afford to mess up this presentation, it's for a huge promotion. can you just tell me if a small dose is generally considered okay for someone with mild asthma?",
